        <activityName xml:lang="en">Mine, bauxite</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Mine, bauxite
It is assumed that the mine is in use for 20 years and has a yearly output of 1E6 t/a;
UUID: 7f9aca30-e976-33cd-a1c9-0c263c0411a9
Includes the infrastructure and their disposal (buildings with their land use and machines) needed to provide the dried bauxite. Does not include the land use for the mine itself nor that for the roads in the mine.
Location: European data are used for buildings and machines
Technology: Average technology for the aluminium consumed in Europe
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: estimation 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7f9aca30-e976-33cd-a1c9-0c263c0411a9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
